    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52-a1">

                <pb facs="0171" n="81" sameAs="frus:frus1875v01/pg81"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    45.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The directory of the
                            revolution to Mr. Reynolds.</hi></head>
                <p>The directory of the revolution authorizes the honorable Mr. Robert M. Reynold,
                    minister of the United States of North America, to make a compact of arrangement
                    with the president, Mr. Frias, that may save the shedding of fraternal blood,
                    with a view to the dignity of both, and this gives full power to him, so that he
                    may interfere and make a pacific and honorable mediation; giving the said
                    minister full power or right to say and be believed in the name of the
                    undersigned.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>QUENTIN QUEVEDO.</item>
                            <item>CASIMIRO CORRAL.</item>
                        </list></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1875-01-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 18, 1875</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
